NAME
     mstreamd – The macOS photo stream agent.

DESCRIPTION
     mstreamd is the photo stream agent.  It is responsible for My Photo
     Stream and Shared Albums for Photos.

SEE ALSO
     cloudphotod(8), photolibraryd(8)

